    "name": "TeachingPlan - 子模块完整CRUD总览 (20260721)",
    "description": "TeachingPlanController 子模块 CRUD 总体接口文档（前端联调）。\n\n基址: {{baseUrl}} + context-path /csys\n控制器: @RequestMapping(\"/teachingPlan\")\n统一返回:\n  - DataSet: { code, msg, data }\n  - Message: { code, msg }\n  - DataTable(仅列表页): { code, msg, rows, total }\n\n【CRUD 完整性结论】用户点名的 8 块均已具备完整 CRUD：\n1. 教员团队 teacher\n2. 课程概述 section\n3. 课程目标 objective + 支撑毕业要求 objectiveRef（另有 saveWithRefs 组合保存）\n4. 教学内容 content\n5. 目标达成设计 targetDesign\n6. 实验/实践 practiceItem + practiceItemDetail\n7. 考核评价 assessment\n8. 教学条件 condition（教材 textbook 另有独立 CRUD）\n\n【计分规则 scoreRule 特别说明】（20260721 更新）\n- 落库位置: 主表 t_csys_teaching_plan.score_rule（不是 assessment 表字段）\n- 保存方式（二选一或并用）:\n  1) POST/PUT /teachingPlan/assessment  body 可选 scoreRule：有值则顺带回写主表\n  2) POST /teachingPlan/save  body.plan.scoreRule\n- 回传:\n  GET /list → TeachingPlanListVo.scoreRule\n  GET /detail → TeachingPlanDetailVo.scoreRule\n  GET /assessment/list → 每条 assessment.scoreRule 填充同一主表值\n- scoreSystem 是「成绩评定制」(百分制/五级制/两级制)，与 scoreRule 不同\n- 详细示例见 doc/20260721_125900_api.postman_collection.json\n\n关联辅助接口: /scheme/list, /major/list, /courseGraduation/{courseId}, /targetDesign/knowledgeUnitInit/{courseId}",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:9219", "description": "服务地址。bootstrap: port=9219, context-path=/csys" },
    { "key": "planId", "value": "55", "description": "教学计划id t_csys_teaching_plan.id" },
    { "key": "courseId", "value": "1001", "description": "总库课程id t_csys_course.id" },
    { "key": "schemeId", "value": "200", "description": "培养方案id t_csys_training_scheme.id" },
    { "key": "objectiveId", "value": "301", "description": "教学目标id" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "401", "description": "实验/实践项目id" },
    { "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "通用子表主键，删除用" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 主表/辅助",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 保存教学计划主表(含计分规则scoreRule)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": {\n    \"id\": null,\n    \"sourceCourseId\": {{courseId}},\n    \"planType\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1.0\",\n    \"currentFlag\": 1,\n    \"enabledTerm\": \"2026年春季学期\",\n    \"status\": 0,\n    \"scoreRule\": \"总评成绩 = 形成性考核×40% + 终结性考核×60%。形成性考核含平时作业、实验报告；终结性考核为期末闭卷考试。\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/csys/teachingPlan/save",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["csys", "teachingPlan", "save"]
            },
            "description": "POST /teachingPlan/save\n\n入参 TeachingPlanSaveVo { plan: TeachingPlan }\n\n【计分规则保存】\nplan.scoreRule (String/text) → t_csys_teaching_plan.score_rule\n- 亦可在 POST/PUT /assessment body.scoreRule 顺带回写主表（推荐考核页用）\n- assessment.scoreSystem 是成绩评定制，与 scoreRule 不同\n- id 为空时按 (sourceCourseId, planType) 查重：已存在则 update，否则 insert\n- planType 必填，前端传入不覆盖\n\n回传: /list、/detail、/assessment/list 均返回 scoreRule\n返回 DataSet<Long> data=planId"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "成功 - 返回planId",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json;charset=UTF-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": 200,\n  \"msg\": \"操作成功\",\n  \"data\": 55\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
